{
  "version": 1,
  "note": "Seed catalogue for the Talking Head page. `audio_url` is null on every entry by design: the clips are supplied later. An entry with no audio is offered and marked 'audio not supplied yet' rather than hidden, so adding a link is the only step needed to make it playable. Add languages by adding a key under `dialogues`; the UI reads this file and does not need a code change.",
  "categories": [
    {
      "id": "slogan",
